WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.583
Desktop: explore the sidebar without leaving the article.

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:05.333
Refresh shows loading and completion. Network delay is simulated.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:07.417
Expand a chapter to browse its pages.

00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:10.167
Open a nested page. Breadcrumbs and selection follow along.

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:12.333
Jump straight to a section using the page outline.

00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:17.167
Search stays in its familiar position at the top.

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:20.750
Open the matching passage, with its source revision.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.417
Page discussion remains shared by people and agents.
